From d590be2e7708ceece27da0346932642ede98c68d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sumedha Sanjay Shenolikar <shenolik@qti.qualcomm.com> 
Date: Thu, 1 Aug 2019 10:13:04 -0700
Signed-off-by: Sumedha Sanjay Shenolikar <shenolik@qti.qualcomm.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sd-bus: Allow extra users to communicate

Rebased for systemd 259.5 (function parameter renamed call->m, blank
lines around capability check already removed upstream; only the
sender_uid allow-list hunk is needed).

---
 src/libsystemd/sd-bus/bus-convenience.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libsystemd/sd-bus/bus-convenience.c b/src/libsystemd/sd-bus/bus-convenience.c
index 4ec0616..d5b7f57 100644
--- a/src/libsystemd/sd-bus/bus-convenience.c
+++ b/src/libsystemd/sd-bus/bus-convenience.c
@@ -733,6 +733,10 @@ _public_ int sd_bus_query_sender_privilege(sd_bus_message *m, int capability) {
                         if (sender_uid == our_uid)
                                 return 1;
 
+                        /* Other specific users also allowed access (radio) */
+                        if (sender_uid == 1001 )
+                                return 1;
+
                         /* Sender is root, we are not root. */
                         if (our_uid != 0 && sender_uid == 0)
                                 return 1;
-- 
1.9.1
